Clone Repository
git clone <your-repo-url>
cd gitk8s

Note: Copy repo
--------------------------------------------
Git Remote

git remote -v
git remote add origin <repo-url> --> (if not exists)
git remote remove origin
git remote show origin

Note: origin = default remote name
      Manage repo connection
---------------------------------------------------      
      
Push Code to Remote
git push -u origin main

Git Workflow (Branching & Merging)
Create Feature Branch
git checkout -b k8s_demo_ubuntu
git add .
git commit -m "ubuntu pod yaml"
git push -u origin k8s_demo_ubuntu

Switch to Main & Sync
git checkout main
git pull origin main

Note:Push and Pull sycn local and remote
-----------------------------------------------

Merge Feature Branch
git merge k8s_demo_ubuntu
git push origin main
------------------------------------------------

Delete Branch
git branch -d k8s_demo_ubuntu (local)
git push origin --delete k8s_demo_ubuntu (branch)
---------------------------------------------------

Useful Commands
git status
git log --oneline --graph
